OL,3,GNEWSATide-trapped dog and walker
OL,4,Arescued from cave
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and his dog have been rescued
OL,7,Ffrom a cave where they sought shelter
OL,8,Fafter being cut off by the tide.
OL,10,FThe dog walker and his Belgian Malinois
OL,11,Fwere on the shore between Workington
OL,12,Fand Salterbeck in west Cumbria when
OL,13,Fthey got into difficulty at about 10:00
OL,14,FGMT on Monday.
OL,16,FMaryport and Whitehaven coastguard
OL,17,Fteams carried out a rope rescue from
OL,18,Fthe clifftop after poor weather
OL,19,Fhampered attempts by Workington RNLI to
OL,20,Fland its rescue boat.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
