OL,3,GNEWSATide-trapped dog and walker
OL,4,Arescued from cave
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The casualty and dog were found to be
OL,7,Ftrapped and shaken but otherwise
OL,8,Funhurt," Maryport coastguard said. "On
OL,9,Fthe clifftop it was a happy moment
OL,10,Fwatching the owner and dog be
OL,11,Freunited."
